1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,450
Rink Field Guide. The Tournament Grandparent.

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,100
Habitat: Top row of the bleachers, under a blanket older than the coach.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,700
Call: "Which one is ours again?"

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,300
Diet: Rink hot chocolate. Crackers from a purse that holds everything.

5
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:11,900
How To Spot: Cheers for every save. Both goalies.

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,500
Behavior: Drove four hours. Up for the 7 AM game anyway.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:20,900
Field note: Has never once left before the handshake line.

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:21,000
Follow for more from the rink.

